@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    Layout = "_Layout";
}
<section class="py-4">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4" style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: July 2026</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p>We collect information you provide when creating a profile — your name, email, date of birth, gender, photos, and preferences such as what you're looking for in a partner. We also collect your interactions (likes, messages, ratings) to facilitate connections.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
        <p>Your data powers the dating experience: profile matching, suggested connections, messaging, and safety features. We use aggregated data to improve our recommendation algorithms and detect fraudulent or harmful behavior.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Profile Visibility</h5>
        <p>Your profile (photos, bio, interests) is visible to other registered members. Your exact location is never shared — only your city. Messages between matches are private and end-to-end encrypted.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Data Retention</h5>
        <p>We retain your data while your account is active. If you delete your account, all personal data is permanently removed within 30 days. Chat logs may be retained anonymously for safety audits.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">5. Your Control</h5>
        <p>You can edit or delete any part of your profile at any time. Use "Manage Profile" to update your info or "Delete Account" to remove everything. For help, <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">contact us</a>.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">6. Reporting &amp; Safety</h5>
        <p>If someone makes you feel unsafe, use the Report button on their profile. Our moderation team reviews all reports within 24 hours. Blocked users cannot see your profile or contact you.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">7. Cookies</h5>
        <p>We use essential cookies for login and security. Optional cookies help us personalize your experience. You can change your cookie preferences at any time in your account settings.</p>
    </div>
</section>
